  "pseudoCode": "FUNCTION rotate(matrix):\n    n = LENGTH(matrix)\n    FOR i FROM 0 TO n - 1 DO:\n        FOR j FROM i TO n - 1 DO:\n            SWAP(matrix[i][j], matrix[j][i])\n        END FOR\n    END FOR\n    FOR i FROM 0 TO n - 1 DO:\n        REVERSE(matrix[i])\n    END FOR\nEND FUNCTION",
